per-fold PR AUC: mean 0.4963  sd 0.0270  range [0.4707, 0.5295]
That sd is fold-to-fold variation, not the uncertainty on a comparison.
Folds differ in size and positive rate, and PR AUC depends on the base
rate, so a model scores highest on the richest fold whatever its merit.
To compare two models, pair them fold by fold: --compare-features.
